<title>NETHERLANDS: Gist-Brocades details '96 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Gist-Brocades details '96 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biotechnology and food ingredients maker Gist-Brocades NV said on Monday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 40 held.</p>
<p>In February, it announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.60 guilders, up from 1.50 in 1995. The payment could be taken up in cash or as an alternative dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Gist-Brocades' shares closed at 66.90 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday, up 1.10 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
